================================================================================================
Tournament Analysis
================================================================================================
Vertices are proof carriers, not runners or arcs.
Pairwise observable: how much primitive packet/address data survives before
scalarization.  Switch: carriers preserving both divisor and Boolean
Mobius labels rank above carriers that collapse them.
Hamiltonian path:
  divisor_mobius_phi > exact_period_unit_packets > full_B3_tiling_recursion > even_B2_half_recursion > odd_B3_half_recursion > product_lattice_packet_ledger > scalar_projection_guardrail
Challenged assumption: the three tiling recurrences are three unrelated
formulas.  They are all Mobius kernels; the differences come from which
quotient pushes the kernel to sizes/depths.
